// ATT&CK: execution
// Tags: detection.emerging-threats
// Description: Detects Log4J Wstomcat process execution as seen in Mint Sandstorm activity
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2023/04/18/nation-state-threat-actor-mint-sandstorm-refines-tradecraft-to-attack-high-value-targets/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules-emerging-threats/2023/TA/Mint-Sandstorm/proc_creation_win_apt_mint_sandstorm_log4j_wstomcat_execution.yml
